('creature_legendary_cazador','fallout,creature,legendary_cazador','Legendary Cazador','This massive mutated wasp possesses compound eyes that track rapid movement across a wide visual spectrum and antennae tuned to chemical trails. A neurotoxic venom delivered through a barbed stinger incapacitates prey within moments for consumption by the hive. Pack hunting instincts drive coordinated aerial attacks where individuals flank and harass targets relentlessly. The legendary specimen exhibits heightened aggression and more potent venom synthesis than typical hive members. Solitary threats are engaged without hesitation when territory or prey is contested.','Larger and more vividly marked than common cazadors with iridescent chitin plates shifting between deep amber and black. The stinger gleams with visible venom residue and wing beats produce a deeper resonant hum.','Aggressively territorial and perpetually alert with predatory instincts that prioritize swift engagement over caution. Recognizes only hierarchy within the hive and responds to all other creatures as prey or threats.','{"hive_queen":"Serve and protect without question","swarm_mates":"Coordinate hunts and defend together","intruders":"Drive off or sting into paralysis","prey":"Pursue relentlessly until venom takes hold"}','Apex aerial hunter and hive enforcer','* Venomous sting with rapid neurotoxin delivery
* High-speed aerial pursuit and flanking
