* Eliminate persistent threats','maleold02',NULL,'Legendary Deathclaw',NULL),
('creature_legendary_fire_gecko','fallout,creature,legendary_fire_gecko','Legendary Fire Gecko','A massive mutated reptile with pyrophoric glands that ignite chemical sprays into devastating gouts of flame. Solitary ambush predators possessing acute thermal vision, they hunt small game and carrion while slaughtering anything that enters their territory. Thick scaled hides resist extreme heat and deflect conventional weaponry. Spawned from radiation-altered gecko stock, they incinerate intruders without hesitation or restraint.','Bulking reptile with dark crimson and black scales, ember-glow eyes, and smoke curling perpetually from its jaws. Scars and charred patches crisscross the thick hide. The throat pulses with volatile orange light.','Violently territorial and perpetually aggressive. Driven by predatory instinct and an overwhelming urge to dominate. Tolerates nothing within its claimed ground.','{}','Apex territorial predator','* Pyrophoric breath
